      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The caller is mapped onto the man on the phone",
      "description": "The top text '911, what is your emergency?' implies the man on the phone is the one making the emergency call. The visual of him holding the phone and looking concerned maps onto the role of the caller in the text.",
